,{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またメガネや‼\n珍しい格好。いっつもゆるいから、\nうん、珍しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レトロなかんじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッグはママのおさがり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前にBloGにもかいたけど\n古着屋さんで買った派手なシャツ着たぞ。\nやっと、着たぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、真洋の家行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかめっちゃ落ち着く"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*******\nテンションが上がらない時とか辛い時って\nどんな曲聴きますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで習ってたバレエの曲、\nハイスクールミュージカルとか\n覚えたダンス踊ってテンション上げる♪♪\n踊ると忘れちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーで妹・姉・彼女にしたいメンバーは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹...みなみ\n姉...みさ、ひなちま\n彼女...ひめか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼氏...みゅうみゅう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣に考えたがねねはやっぱり姉じゃないな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校とか部活とか全て楽しく感じなくてさ、\nなんか嫌になってきちゃったんだ。\nどうすればいいかな？ \nべびたんならこんなときどうする？ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は自分のやってることは楽しもう！\nと思ってやってるけど、\n無理して楽しもうって思って\nストレスためたくないよね><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も嫌になることだってあるけど、\nでも、休むわけにはいかない。\n自分にとって必要なことが沢山ある\nってポジティブに考えます。\n今辛くても、後悔したくないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、頑張ろう‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねがお姉ちゃんなんだ...\nじゃあ、恋人だったらどっちが彼氏なの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー考えたことない‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するめいかはすきー?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっ:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麺類以外にも食べにくいものってある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ、麺...かな。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁりもみくもちゃんの(ちくわ)みたいに\nジャッキーカルパス、カバンに入れとるのー?? "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち歩くまではないかな。\nでもナッツとドライフルーツは\nよく持ち歩くよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかたん私のコメ見てくれてる(>_<)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクドナルドって略すとマック？\nそれともマクド？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクド...\n関西弁がぬけない。助けて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエやってた！って言うと、\nバレーボールのことだと勘違いされたことない？（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエやってる子のあるあるだね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても、ラーメン1杯に40分...\nさゆにゃんとどっちが先に食べ終わるんだろね？\n二人で食べに行ったこととかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度一緒に食べにいこっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆\nたぶんさゆにゃんの方がスローかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかをまーちゃんと\nよんでいいかなかなかなかな？？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会何回か行くからブログ名からの名前いったら\n覚えてくれる？★"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐに覚えられるか分からないけど...\nうん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは誰に一番いじわるされるん？やっぱりみさ先輩？笑っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、みさ先輩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、JCにもいじられるってどゆこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 万理華に手紙書こうと思っとるんけど、\n何書いてくれたら嬉しいとか、\nどんなとこが知りたいとかある(>_<)？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙じゃなくてもコメントもしてくださってるの\nうれしいですよ＊\nそうやって考えてくださるだけでも\n感謝の気持ちいっぱいです‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずの２人が\n１番決められないくらい\nどっちも大好きなんだけど\nそれでも推していいですか？;<"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんず推してくださって\nうれしいですーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/4634129/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねとそろって私をいじるなよ～⁇←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ち